{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686250/extras/desc_foftfdemo.gif?t=1745740354\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face of Fear: The Forester</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After being laid off from your old job, you started looking through available vacancies, where you come across one tempting job offer as a forester, you just need to go to the forest for a couple of months and perform simple duties, and they also promise to pay well. Forest, silence, nature, what could go wrong here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686250/extras/photocamera.gif?t=1745740354\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a demo version of a small game. It only includes the first story chapter, which takes place at a gas station and a roadside diner. The main location in the forest itself will only appear in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is still in development. If you are interested, add it to your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version is short, about 15 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686250/extras/zisdinerfragmentfromcar2.gif?t=1745740354\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686250?t=1745740354","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686250/8d1131dd6353df5a855878f59da426aaaf9e2045/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745740354","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686250/c95f46635882efce77030b637463f7f62755ae3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745740354","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686250/c95f46635882ef